<div class="content-page">
  <div class="content-page__inner">
    <h1 class="content-page__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="content-page__intro">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Summary</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. There are no accounts, no analytics, no cookies, and no third-party tracking.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Data Storage</h2>
      <p>All data (lesson progress, student profiles, and theme preference) is stored locally on your device using your browser's <code>localStorage</code>. This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to us or any third party.</p>
      <p>You can export your data as a JSON file at any time from the Lessons page. You can delete all data by clearing your browser's local storage or using the Reset button.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p><strong>Bunny Fonts:</strong> Open Phonics loads fonts from <a href="https://fonts.bunny.net">Bunny Fonts</a>, a GDPR-compliant, privacy-focused font delivery service. Bunny Fonts does not log IP addresses or use cookies.</p>
      <p><strong>Hosting:</strong> The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect standard web server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited) as part of their infrastructure. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>No other third-party services are used.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics is designed for use by children with adult supervision. We do not collect any information from children or adults. There are no accounts, forms, or input fields that collect personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Open Source</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics is open source. You can review the complete source code to verify these privacy claims.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a href="/contact/">the contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>